      "Energy density in both $\\sigma\\varepsilon$ and $\\sigma^2/2Y$ forms.",
      "Quasi-static vs sudden-load energy split ($\\frac{1}{2}$).",
      "Clamped thermal stress independent of length.",
      "Distinguish $K$ (bulk) from $k$ (spring).",
      "Check $\\Delta L$ against $k = YA/L$ before answering."
